1
00:00:08,173 --> 00:00:09,173
By the way.

2
00:00:09,592 --> 00:00:11,094
Your balls were pretty fast.

3
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:11,678
Of course they were.

4
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:13,930
Other schools would have
recruited you by now.

5
00:00:14,597 --> 00:00:15,640
Why did you come here?

6
00:00:16,056 --> 00:00:17,100
None of your business.

7
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:19,310
Why are you like that, huh?

8
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:21,688
Anyway.

9
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:23,415
From tomorrow
when we are group training

10
00:00:23,857 --> 00:00:24,857
join us.

11
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:27,235
Why should I?

12
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:29,320
You lost the bet!

13
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:32,031
I told you.

14
00:00:32,406 --> 00:00:34,159
The ball was weird
so it doesn't count.

15
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:35,618
Stop being so stubborn!

16
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,253
You can't play baseball alone!

17
00:00:45,253 --> 00:00:46,337
It's something we do

18
00:00:46,546 --> 00:00:47,797
as a group
no matter the result!

19
00:00:47,839 --> 00:00:50,258
With skills like yours
it really doesn't matter.

20
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:51,508
What?

21
00:00:58,016 --> 00:00:59,225
Don't touch me.
